abstract: >-
  A retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) application for scientific
  literature analysis: it processes and indexes a local collection of
  PDF papers into a ChromaDB vector database, answers complex questions
  about them with Google Gemini, and reports precise source attribution
  down to file name, page number and the individual passages behind
  each answer. Includes a desktop graphical user interface, adjustable
  chunking and retrieval parameters, and export of results.
  Funded by the Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft (DFG, German Research
  Foundation) under the National Research Data Infrastructure –
  NFDI 38/1 – project number 460247524 (NFDI-MatWerk consortium).
